{"schemaVersion":"boolean-creep-review/v1","id":"docgen-quality-scope-flags","sourceSha":"5f1a88ddaa215372e528b2f900207f0663644a25","reviewer":"grok-cli","evidenceStatus":"pass","designStatus":"finding","findings":[{"area":"design","severity":"blocking","note":"Migration inventory tells Docgen.command.ts to call resolveDocgenQualityTargets with `{ scope, packageSelector }`, but the target is a tagged union whose package case owns a string selector and other cases omit that field. The command's packageSelector is Option<string>, so that bag is unrepresentable and reintroduces the optional-payload shape the union deletes. Name schema-derived case construction at both the quality command and worker-eval adapters."}]}
